  "description": "Roslyn analyzers enforcing opinionated .NET conventions at compile time. 30 rules with code fixes covering design (sealed-by-default, async void, sync-over-async, ConfigureAwait, in-modifier safety, primary constructor fields, FileSystemInfo equality), reliability (TimeProvider, IHttpClientFactory, DateTime.Parse roundtrip, GeneratedRegex timeout/backtracking, hardcoded /tmp paths, Task.FromResult sync I/O), performance (MinBy/MaxBy, HttpCompletionOption, string interpolation, ToArray in foreach, FrozenSet allocation, multi-string OR-chain, static readonly frozen collections), and style (string.Empty, Encoding.UTF8, XML doc comments, temp path conventions).",
